      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Steps to Handle Wind Damage"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Inspect Safely: Walk around your home from the ground and look for missing shingles , bent flashing, or granule loss."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Document Everything: Take clear photos and videos of any damaged areas on the roof and any debris on the ground."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Prevent Leaks: Use emergency measures like tarping or buckets if water is getting inside your home."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "File a Claim: Call your insurance company quickly to open a storm damage claim and get your claim number."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you can tell me what specific damage you see (like missing shingles or a leak) and your roof's age, I can help you estimate repair needs or insurance steps."
      }
